            "id": 6670107,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 台玻(1802)股價拉至漲停，漲停價58.1元，成交181,002張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>台玻(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1802:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1802\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1802-TW</a>)23日12:46上漲5.2元，股價漲停報58.1元，委買10,337張，成交181,002張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為平板玻璃之製造與銷售。玻璃纖維布及玻璃纖維束之製造與銷售。玻璃器皿之製造與銷售。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>台玻(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:1802:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/1802\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">1802-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌37.84%，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌17.5%，短期股價無明顯表現。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：-106,176 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-99,908 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：-10,614 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：+4,346 張</li> <li>融資增減：+10,476 張</li> <li>融券增減：-8,734 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
